## 6. Sequence Diagrams

### Payment Creation Flow

```plantuml::sequence-payment-create.puml::docs/diagrams/sequence-payment-create.puml
@startuml Payment Creation Sequence
!theme plain

participant "Client" as C
participant "PaymentController" as PC
participant "PaymentService" as PS
participant "PaymentRepository" as PR
participant "EventPublisher" as EP
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "MySQL" as DB

C -> PC: POST /api/payments\n{amount, description}
activate PC

PC -> PC: Validate request
PC -> PS: createPayment(request)
activate PS

PS -> PS: Generate payment ID
PS -> PS: Set status = PENDING
PS -> PR: save(payment)
activate PR

PR -> DB: INSERT payment
DB --> PR: Success
PR --> PS: Payment entity
deactivate PR

PS -> EP: publishPaymentCreated(event)
activate EP

EP -> MQ: Send to exchange
MQ --> EP: Acknowledged
EP --> PS: Success
deactivate EP

PS --> PC: PaymentResponse
PC --> C: 201 Created\n{id, status, amount}
deactivate PS
deactivate PC

@enduml
```

### Payment Status Query Flow

```plantuml::sequence-payment-query.puml::docs/diagrams/sequence-payment-query.puml
@startuml Payment Query Sequence
!theme plain

participant "Client" as C
participant "PaymentController" as PC
participant "PaymentService" as PS
participant "PaymentRepository" as PR
participant "MySQL" as DB
participant "Cache" as Cache

C -> PC: GET /api/payments/{id}
activate PC

PC -> PS: getPayment(id)
activate PS

PS -> Cache: Check cache
Cache --> PS: Cache miss

PS -> PR: findById(id)
activate PR

PR -> DB: SELECT * FROM payment
DB --> PR: Payment data
PR --> PS: Payment entity
deactivate PR

PS -> Cache: Store in cache
PS -> PS: Map to DTO
PS --> PC: PaymentResponse
PC --> C: 200 OK\n{payment details}
deactivate PS
deactivate PC

@enduml
```

### Batch Job Processing Flow

```plantuml::sequence-batch-job.puml::docs/diagrams/sequence-batch-job.puml
@startuml Batch Job Processing Sequence
!theme plain

participant "Scheduler" as S
participant "PaymentMaintenanceRunner" as PMR
participant "PaymentMaintenanceService" as PMS
participant "PaymentRepository" as PR
participant "PushgatewayConfig" as PG
participant "MySQL" as DB
participant "Prometheus" as P

S -> PMR: Trigger job (cron)
activate PMR

PMR -> PMS: runMaintenance()
activate PMS

PMS -> PR: findExpiredPayments()
activate PR
PR -> DB: SELECT expired payments
DB --> PR: List<Payment>
PR --> PMS: Expired payments
deactivate PR

loop For each batch
  PMS -> PMS: Process batch
  PMS -> PR: updateBatch(payments)
  PR -> DB: UPDATE status
  DB --> PR: Success
end

PMS -> PMS: Calculate metrics
PMS --> PMR: Maintenance complete

PMR -> PG: pushMetrics()
activate PG
PG -> P: Push metrics
P --> PG: Acknowledged
PG --> PMR: Success
deactivate PG

deactivate PMS
deactivate PMR

@enduml
```

