## Explanation

The error occurred because the MySQL connector dependency was using the deprecated `mysql:mysql-connector-java` artifact without a version. For Spring Boot 3.x, the correct dependency is `com.mysql:mysql-connector-j`, which is managed by the Spring Boot parent POM and doesn't require an explicit version. This change resolves the Maven build error and ensures compatibility with Spring Boot 3.3.5.






