## Explanation

The import error was caused by using the wrong package path for `MeterRegistryCustomizer`. In newer Micrometer versions, this class is directly in `io.micrometer.core.instrument` package, not in the `.config` subpackage. I also added `@EnableScheduling` annotation to enable the scheduled metric pushing functionality. The corrected import path resolves the compilation error and maintains all the original functionality.






